steps.text:
Need font licensing? Noto is OFL, fine. Use TTC. Browser may default first face. We'll test. Could maybe use `font-family: "Noto Sans CJK SC"` via local and @font-face. Let's define:
```
@font-face { font-family:'NotoSansCJK'; src: local('Noto Sans CJK SC'), url('assets/fonts/NotoSansCJK-Regular.ttc') format('truetype'); font-weight: 400; }
```
Local should pick SC. Bold similarly. If TTC url fallback, Chrome may choose first face (JP). Since local exists, good. Need `font-feature-settings`? no.

Now write SPEC and STORYLINES.

